<view class="data-v-d38065ce"><view wx:if="{{a}}" class="card data-v-d38065ce"><text class="meta data-v-d38065ce">加载中…</text></view><view wx:elif="{{b}}" class="card error-card data-v-d38065ce"><text class="err data-v-d38065ce">{{c}}</text><button class="action-btn data-v-d38065ce" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="{{d}}">回首页</button><button class="ghost-btn data-v-d38065ce" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="{{e}}">查看订单</button></view><view wx:elif="{{f}}" class="data-v-d38065ce"><view class="{{['success-header', 'data-v-d38065ce', j]}}"><text class="success-icon data-v-d38065ce">{{g}}</text><text class="success-title data-v-d38065ce">{{h}}</text><text class="success-status data-v-d38065ce">{{i}}</text></view><view class="card amount-card data-v-d38065ce"><text class="amount-label data-v-d38065ce">实付金额</text><text class="amount data-v-d38065ce">{{k}}</text><text wx:if="{{l}}" class="pay-channel data-v-d38065ce">{{m}}</text><text wx:if="{{n}}" class="zero-hint data-v-d38065ce">本次未取走商品，未产生扣款</text></view><view wx:if="{{o}}" class="card balance-card data-v-d38065ce"><view class="data-v-d38065ce"><text class="balance-caption data-v-d38065ce">扣款前余额</text><text class="balance-number data-v-d38065ce">{{p}}</text></view><text class="balance-arrow data-v-d38065ce">→</text><view class="data-v-d38065ce"><text class="balance-caption data-v-d38065ce">扣款后余额</text><text class="balance-number strong data-v-d38065ce">{{q}}</text></view><text class="trial-note data-v-d38065ce">本页余额为账户余额展示；免密渠道扣款以微信/支付宝为准</text></view><view class="card data-v-d38065ce"><text class="section-title data-v-d38065ce">商品明细</text><view wx:if="{{r}}" class="data-v-d38065ce"><view wx:for="{{s}}" wx:for-item="line" wx:key="d" class="line data-v-d38065ce"><text class="line-name data-v-d38065ce">{{line.a}} × {{line.b}}</text><text class="line-amt data-v-d38065ce">{{line.c}}</text></view></view><text wx:else class="empty-lines data-v-d38065ce">本次未识别到取走商品</text><view wx:if="{{t}}" class="sum-row data-v-d38065ce"><tex